{"3780660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plane Crazy Championship Edition", "steam_appid": 3780660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>What's New in this re-release of Plane Crazy</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plane Crazy Championship Edition is the latest version of the game, including all officially released tracks and languages on PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for high resolutions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern gamepad support.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional quality of life configuration options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-skip all intros.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invertible Y-Axis when using gamepads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent first person cockpit view option.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern system compatibility and crash fixes, ensuring the game runs smoothly on today’s hardware and operating systems.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready to experience high speed arcade-style racing action! Easy to learn…impossible to master!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Goal: Earn the title of the quickest airborne Speed Freak! It will take a lot more than fancy flying, quick reactions, sheer nerve, and skill to win here…you gotta be Plane Crazy! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plane Crazy features nine beautifully rendered 3D rendered race-courses. Each with dramatically different landscapes and hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional environmental effects like crosswinds and down-drafts present tough challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different classes of aircraft. All customizable to meet the varying demands of each race-course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three intensely addictive modes of play: Quick Race, Ghost Race and Championship Race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your hottest plane from Single-Player mode and use it to blow away the competition in live, head-to-head Multi-Player battle races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect eight unique power-ups as you fly and use them to boost your speed…or blow your opponent apart.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready to experience high speed arcade-style racing action! Easy to learn…impossible to master!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Goal: Earn the title of the quickest airborne Speed Freak! It will take a lot more than fancy flying, quick reactions, sheer nerve, and skill to win here…you gotta be Plane Crazy! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plane Crazy features nine beautifully rendered 3D rendered race-courses. Each with dramatically different landscapes and hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional environmental effects like crosswinds and down-drafts present tough challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different classes of aircraft. All customizable to meet the varying demands of each race-course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three intensely addictive modes of play: Quick Race, Ghost Race and Championship Race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your hottest plane from Single-Player mode and use it to blow away the competition in live, head-to-head Multi-Player battle races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect eight unique power-ups as you fly and use them to boost your speed…or blow your opponent apart.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Get ready to experience high speed arcade-style racing action! Easy to learn…impossible to master! Your Goal: Earn the title of the quickest airborne Speed Freak! It will take a lot more than fancy flying, quick reactions,